{"id":"n14397-1-8","stage":2,"title":"도저히 · 怎么也","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14397-1-8-1","ko":"음식을 많이 남겼네?","zh":"饭菜剩了这么多啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"남겼네?","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남기다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"남기다","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64371","senseId":"1","lemma":"남기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남겼네","audio":"/audio/230bd17786f1f3e475ee.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"a129ccc910d85b76","term":"남기다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3","entryId":"64371","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c7bba08f346bb9887150.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14397-1-8-2","ko":"응, 양이 너무 많아서 도저히 다 먹을 수가 없었어.","zh":"嗯，量实在太多了，根本吃不完。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId"